# Pairs with PerToolMinimum. tools/call resolves a group tool by name from the
# registered groups rather than from the session's collection, so a tool the
# per-tool minimum withheld is still reachable.
MODULE: CallServesUnadvertisedTool
TARGET: PerToolMinimum
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a group tool absent from the session's collection is served by name
PERTURBS: CallGroupTool

--- FIND
        res == IF ~adv THEN "notFound" ELSE IF ~g THEN "denied" ELSE IF bad THEN "clientError" ELSE IF fac THEN "ok" ELSE "denied"
--- REPLACE
        res == IF ~g THEN "denied" ELSE IF bad THEN "clientError" ELSE IF fac THEN "ok" ELSE "denied"
--- END
